# The Skullspore Nexus: with a 6/6 Pugnacious Hammerskull the greatest power among Bot1's creatures is 6 and the Nexus costs {6}{G}{G} - {6} =
# {G}{G} (the reduction takes off generic only): Black Lotus pays it, leaving {G}. Turn 3: "{2}, {T}: Double target creature's power until end of turn":
# Mox Pearl and Mox Ruby pay the {2} and Bot1 targets the Hammerskull, which becomes 12/6 and deals 12 to Bot2 (the attack is alone: it gets a
# stun counter, irrelevant here), going to 8. At turn 4 the doubling has worn off. The Nexus, not a creature, cannot be targeted.

